        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9023/254, Industrial Hanger 10 Inch Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 10 Inch Hangar Cabinet Pull has an overall length of 10-1/2 inches. It is available in 6 modern finishes including polished chrome and oil-rubbed bronze. This modern 9023 cabinet door handle made by Omnia is easy to install as it comes with all the necessary mounting hardware. The Industrial Hanger 10 Inch Cabinet Handle is perfect for updating your home and bringing it into the contemporary scene. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9023\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9023 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
